OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,13,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,14,     Fbeyond, including Elgar's iconic
OL,15,     FEnigma Variations performed by the
OL,16,     FBBC National Orchestra of Wales.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Cyril Scott
OL,18,     F5/5. Donald Macleod follows Cyril
OL,19,     FScott through the final decades of
OL,20,     Fhis life, including his turbulent
OL,21,     Frelationship with the BBC.
